{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"games","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"List a game's trades"},"description":"A game's newest fills across every market in it, live: the moneyline, spreads, totals and props, player props included, newest first. The same rows the 0xinsider game page's activity rail shows a Pro viewer. Every fill, not only large ones; use get_large_trades with event_slug for the game's large trades with review scores.\n\nArgs:\n  - event_slug (string, required): the game's event slug, for example nba-bos-orl-2026-11-01. Matched case-insensitively\n  - limit (number, 1-200, default 100): newest fills to return\n\nReturns: data (each fill's id, traded_at, side, outcome, outcome_index, price, shares, size_usd, the signed spread point, the trader's address, display_name and current grade, and the market's condition_id, title, slug and line_label, its name within the game), has_more (always false: poll again rather than page), event_slug, source_stale and meta. source_stale true means the rows are the game's last complete read while its refresh runs. Deduplicate on id across polls. A 503 read_model_warming means the game's first read is still running: retry after Retry-After. An unknown slug answers not_found; an event outside sports and esports answers market_out_of_scope.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"event_slug":{"description":"The game's event slug, for example nba-bos-orl-2026-11-01; matched case-insensitively","minLength":1,"type":"string"},"limit":{"default":100,"description":"Newest fills to return (1-200, default 100)","maximum":200,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"}},"required":["event_slug"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_game_trades","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"GameTrade":{"properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"market":{"properties":{"condition_id":{"type":"string"},"id":{"type":"string